# The collected tick ledger is deliberately not published here. It embeds ~2,000
# distinct room names, and room names on this service are anonymous, world-writable
# strings — republishing them wholesale is exactly what this project's own doctrine
# forbids, which is why the sampling manifest stores hashes instead. The derived
# payload is served publicly at /data.json.
